  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Warpforged Cabal",
    "summary": "Whenever one of your **THOUSAND SONS VEHICLE** units is picked to shoot or fight, choose one of these for its attacks:\n\n- If the unit has a friendly **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** model within 6\", you may re-roll a **Hit roll**, a **Wound roll** and a **Damage roll**.\n- If not, you may re-roll just one Hit roll, Wound roll or Damage roll.\n\nWhen one of your **THOUSAND SONS VEHICLE** models with **[Deadly Demise](vsdata:core-ability/deadly-demise)** is **destroyed** within 6\" of a friendly **THOUSAND SONS PSYKER** model, its **[Deadly Demise](vsdata:core-ability/deadly-demise)** deals its **mortal wounds** on a 5+ on the D6 rather than needing a 6.",
